10. Discovery ?attrs=speed — 501 (deferred)
===========================================
HTTP/1.1 501 Not Implemented
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 246

{
  "detail": "Context Source Registration discovery filter 'attrs' is not implemented; only type/id/idPattern/limit/offset/count are honored",
  "title": "Not Implemented",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/OperationNotSupported"
}



