============================================
HTTP/1.1 501 Not Implemented
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 242

{
  "detail": "Context Source Registration discovery filter 'q' is not implemented; only type/id/idPattern/limit/offset/count are honored",
